# Forms, API, Redux

## Forms

- RHF + yup + `yupResolver` only in `container/.../Hooks.ts`
- Fields from `common/formFields`: `InputField`, `DropdownField`, `DatePicker`, `TimePicker`, `TextareaField`, `SwitchField`
- Shared regex: `utils/validationRegex.ts`
- Types for forms/payloads: `container/.../types.ts` (not a giant global types dump)

## API

```ts
// *Apis.ts — URLs from endPoints.ts only
export const getFooListAPI = () =>
  doGetApiCall<ApiListResponse<Foo>>({ url: endPoints.fooList });

// Hooks.ts — Resort CUD / list shape
if (res?.Error_Code === 0 || res?.Message === "Success") {
  setRows(Array.isArray(res.data) ? res.data : []);
}
```

- Base: `process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_API_URL`
- No axios in components or `app/` pages
- List/search/add/update/delete mirror `test` (Resort API docs)

## Auth cookies (`resort*`)

Set on login (`container/auth/login/Hooks.ts`): `resortToken`, `resortTokenType`, `resortUserId`, `resortOrgId`, `resortBranchId`, `resortUserName`, `resortShortName`, `resortUserCode`, `resortIsActive`, `resortStatus`, `resortBranchCode`, `resortBranchName`, `resortName`, `resortOrgSchema`, `resortDatabaseName`.

Clear via `clearAuthCookies()` in `utils/secureCookieHelper.ts`.

## Redux

- Slice in `container/.../*Reducer.ts`; register in `redux/configureStore.ts`
- Sidebar menus from API → `setSidebarData` (never ship static menu arrays)
- Do not store full form drafts in Redux unless the feature already does
